body:
@swinslow - agreed on naming, it should not start with CC

I'm going to update the issue name to avoid any further confusion on that.

I'm still a bit confused as to where this is used in the cited projects - a random poking around, I only found Apache-2.0

@jlovejoy For CoMPAS, I see this at https://github.com/com-pas/compas-open-scd -- referenced in the README and with the EULA in the top level folder at https://github.com/com-pas/compas-open-scd/blob/main/CC-EULA.pdf

I suspect the actual content is part of what's in [this file](https://github.com/com-pas/compas-open-scd/blob/main/src/schemas.ts) in that repo, given the IEC copyright notices.

Another repo in the same project lists the license in a DEP5 file at https://github.com/com-pas/compas-scl-xsd/blob/develop/.reuse/dep5
